\b PiAoIP 2.1.0 - package information\b0\par\par
Windows 11 x64 ASIO audio transport. Close all ASIO hosts before installing, repairing or removing this package.\par\par
This package installs a user-mode ASIO DLL, settings panel, documentation and an inbound UDP 50021 firewall rule limited to the local subnet. It does not install Windows microphone/speaker endpoints or a kernel driver.\par\par
Personal noncommercial use is free under PROJECT-LICENSE.txt. Commercial use requires a separate written paid license from danrey-bilo. Third-party rights are separate: ASIO-SDK-LICENSE.txt contains Steinberg terms. This project license does not replace required Steinberg permissions for distributing an ASIO build. The installer is unsigned unless the distributor signs it separately.\par\par
Raspberry Pi requires the separate ARM64 .deb package and an existing PREEMPT_RT kernel. Read INSTALL-RU.html for configuration and supported hardware.\par
